"2014-01-21T03:48:13-08:00","id":54579,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baroqo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/54098-baalim-an-infernal-lineage?p=54548#post54548\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Awesome!<br /> <br /> An idea about the humor - it may be Ichor. It has the double nature of being &quot;godly&quot; and dangerous.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ichor\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/static/images/icons/enwiki-25.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ichor\" target=\"_blank\"> Ichor - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ichor\" target=\"_blank\"> http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ichor </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> &quot;Ichor originates in <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greek_mythology\" target=\"_blank\">Greek mythology</a>, where it is the ethereal fluid that is the Greek gods' <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blood\" target=\"_blank\">blood</a>, sometimes said to retain the qualities of the immortal's food and drink, <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ambrosia\" target=\"_blank\">ambrosia</a> or nectar.<sup><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ichor#cite_note-homer-1\" target=\"_blank\">[1]</a></sup> It was considered to be golden in color, as well as lethally toxic to mortals.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;In <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pathology\" target=\"_blank\">pathology</a>, &quot;ichor&quot; is an antiquated term for a watery discharge from a wound or ulcer with an unpleasant or <a href=\"http://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/fetid\" target=\"_blank\">fetid</a> (offensive) smell.<sup><span style=\"color:#0645AD\"><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ichor#cite_note-2\" target=\"_blank\">[</a>&quot;</span></sup></div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for that! I've tried to think about an Humor for them, but my mind went blank. Ichor is a great name for their Humor <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-27T12:27:57-08:00","id":59003,"title":"","content":"added Progenitor stories :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-28T09:46:28-08:00","id":59906,"title":"","content":"It seems to me that Disquiet should be about temptation - giving into it, hating yourself for doing so, and blaming the Promethean for making you do so. Sort of like the lustful aspect of the Galateid Disquiet, but broadened to other aspects of sin or &quot;sin,&quot; rather than to other aspects of self-image.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-28T10:24:54-08:00","id":59934,"title":"","content":"yep- that was the direction I was thinking about <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T15:30:22-08:00","id":61781,"title":"","content":"If you're still in need of a Humour for the Baalim, there are some unofficially accepted 5th Humours known as &quot;Supine&quot; and &quot;Leukine&quot;. Supine individuals have tears as their fluid and are considered to be very anxious and dependent on others. They are also very withdrawn and prefer to avoid confrontation with others. Leukine individuals have white plasm (presumably white blood vessels or plasma) and are considered very balanced and neutral, a grey zone within all the other Humours.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1417-reaper-verse","name":"Reaper Verse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1417_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"352"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-17T12:34:26-08:00","id":73835,"title":"","content":"added Disquiet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theon